```toml meta
cacheable = true
l-space   = "stable"
role      = "snapshot-restart one of a wiki's bags to bound its history"
tags      = ["lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/api/pono/affordance", "lar:///engine.wiki.compacts", "candidate"]
title     = "lar:///ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/engine.wiki.compacts"
type      = "text/memetic-wikitext+tiddlywiki"
uri-path  = "ha.ka.ba/lares/afford/engine.wiki.compacts"
```

<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! engine.wiki.compacts ~ a DXOS-style snapshot-restart on one bag

`lares wiki compact <slug> <bag-url>` asks the daemon's bag-compact verb to snapshot one of the wiki's bags and restart its history from that snapshot. The same verb answers `lares bag compact`.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ compact

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`compact` params=`slug/works bag-uri/automerge:abc ~ compact one bag of the wiki`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ slug · bag-uri

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`slug` params=`takes/slug needs/required seat/1 as/<slug> ~ the wiki slug`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`bag-uri` params=`takes/uri needs/required seat/2 as/<bag-uri> ~ the bag's uri`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ vessel

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`vessel` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ the daemon verb runs under the vessel's own did; this handler checks no ocap of its own`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage · daemon-refused

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[engine.wiki.compacts slug/works bag-uri/automerge:abc]] ~ name the slug and the bag`>>
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`daemon-refused` params=`~ the daemon's bag-compact verb refused; its message rides the line, exit 4`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ compacted

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`compacted` params=`exit/0 ~ the compaction's reading`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins`>>

!! skins ~ cli

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares wiki compact

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host door/part spells/[[lares wiki compact]] ~ the terminal`>>
```

